          },
          {
            "label": "General-election link",
            "value": "The candidates or finalists emerging from these contests proceed toward the November 3, 2026 general election, subject to each state's ballot-access and election rules.",
            "source_ids": []
          },
          {
            "label": "State-specific formats",
            "value": "Primary systems are not uniform: Missouri voters may choose a party ballot, while Washington uses a top-two primary in which the two highest vote-getters for an office advance regardless of party preference.",
